    "image_with_text_bHEWNz": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_VUhUp3": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "One-Pan Seafood Skillet with Cannellini & Jammy Tomatoes",
            "heading_size": "title-md",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "text_f8WaMz": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Mark knows that food is medicine, and this One-Pan Seafood Skillet is one of his go-to ways to eat toward long-term health.</p><p>King Salmon and Branzino seared skin-side down until crisp, then nestled into a skillet of jammy tomatoes, cannellini beans, wilted kale and black tiger shrimp folded in. Finished with parsley and a spoonful of salmon roe, it's a complete, nutrient-dense meal ready in 30 - all in one pan.</p><p>This all-in-one dish makes clean eating effortless: one skillet that's built around the omega-3s and high-quality protein that the longevity research keeps coming back to.</p>",
            "text_size": "subtext-md",
            "text_max_size": 32,
            "text_font": "body",
            "secondary_color": false,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
